title: "ADR-0012: Pagination for list endpoints"
summary: List endpoints use cursor pagination. Offset pagination was rejected.
status: approved
owners: ["@harness"]
tags: [fixture, adr]
updated: 2026-10-01
---

## Decision

:::decision{status=accepted date=2026-09-30} Cursor pagination
List endpoints return a `next_cursor` token. Clients pass it back to get the next page.
:::

:::decision{status=rejected date=2026-09-30} Offset pagination
Clients pass `offset` and `limit` on every request.
:::

## Limits

The page size must not exceed 100 items. The default page size is 25.

:::warning
Do not write cursors to logs, because they encode customer ids.
:::

## Open questions

:::question Should cursors expire?
Until this is decided, cursors stay valid for 24 hours.
:::
